From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Match CMake project version to the v1.2.7 release

The v1.2.7 tag still declares 1.2.6 in CMakeLists.txt. Correcting it makes
the installed shared library version, CMake package version and pkg-config
metadata describe the tagged release.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.2 FATAL_ERROR)
-project(edlib VERSION 1.2.6)
+project(edlib VERSION 1.2.7)

 option(EDLIB_ENABLE_INSTALL "Generate the install target" ON)
 option(EDLIB_BUILD_EXAMPLES "Build examples" ON)
